cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite the archived release."
type: software
title: "CWIAL Starter Kit: an ISO/IEC 17025-aligned toolkit for cognitive warfare information metrology"
abstract: >-
  A minimal, dependency-free Python implementation of the Cognitive Warfare
  Information Metrology Framework: a Verified Factual Reference Base, a GUM
  Type A and Type B uncertainty budget engine, belief displacement and
  cognitive attack velocity measurands, an instrument registry, an ISO/IEC
  17025 clause 7.8 report generator, Monte Carlo recovery and detection
  power studies, and metrological characterisation of an LLM or classifier
  used as a narrative coherence scoring instrument.
